{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-3-covderiv-B","title":"def:dc-ch6-3-covderiv-B","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions.md","line":506,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions.tex#def:dc-ch6-3-covderiv-B","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-B]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions.tex","label":"def:dc-ch6-3-covderiv-B","line":1101,"source":"\\begin{definition}[the covariant derivative of the second fundamental form]\n  \\label{def:dc-ch6-3-covderiv-B}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch6-2-B, def:dc-ch6-2-induced-connection, def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection}\n\n  The second fundamental form regarded as a tensor\n  $B:\\mathcal{X}(M)\\times\\mathcal{X}(M)\\times\\mathcal{X}(M)^\\perp\\to\\mathbb{R}$\n  is $B(X,Y,\\eta)=\\langle B(X,Y),\\eta\\rangle$, with covariant derivative\n\n  $$\n  (\\overline{\\nabla}_X B)(Y,Z,\\eta)=X(B(Y,Z,\\eta))-B(\\nabla_X Y,Z,\\eta)-B(Y,\\nabla_X Z,\\eta)-B(Y,Z,\\nabla_X^\\perp\\eta).\n  $$\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[the covariant derivative of the second fundamental form] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a64632d6368362d332d636f7664657269762d42\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_IsometricImmersions%23def%3Adc-ch6-2-B\">↗ def:dc-ch6-2-B</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fbluepri